# =====================================================================
#  Email settings for RoleDar (macOS / Linux)
# =====================================================================
#
#  This is a TEMPLATE. To use it (see the README "Setting up a local
#  schedule" section):
#    1. Copy it:   cp local-secrets.sh.example local-secrets.sh
#    2. Add  local-secrets.sh  to your .gitignore
#    3. Replace the three example values below with your real ones
#
#  Want CSV reports only, no email? You don't need this file at all.
#  Don't copy it, and the scraper writes reports without emailing.
#
#  Where the values come from (see the README "Set up email" section):
#    RESEND_API_KEY  - created in your resend.com dashboard, starts "re_"
#    FROM_EMAIL      - who the mail is "from" (onboarding@resend.dev is fine)
#    NOTIFY_EMAIL    - where the mail should go (your own address)
# =====================================================================

export RESEND_API_KEY=""
export FROM_EMAIL=""
export NOTIFY_EMAIL=""
